#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod:1 of
msgid "Cumulative product within each group."
msgstr "计算每个组内的累积乘积。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod:3 of
msgid "If True, skip null values in the cumulative computation."
msgstr "如果为 True，在累积计算中跳过空值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod:5 of
msgid "Column(s) to accumulate.  If None, all non-group-key columns."
msgstr "要累积的列。如果为 None，则对所有非分组键列进行累积。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.cumprod:8 of
msgid ""
"Lazy LiteFrame with the same row count as the input, containing the per-"
"group cumulative product.  Call ``.execute()`` to materialize."
msgstr ""
"具有与输入相同行数的惰性 LiteFrame，包含每组的累积乘积。调用 ``.execute()"
"`` 来实例化。"

